    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019360/extras/b3006fa6ac79be40850bb4eaf2fd6349.avif?t=1755196744\" width=537 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to read, recognize, and use <i>hiragana\u00a0</i>as you are guided by Keen Reflex through a 35-floor ever-changing labyrinth in an addictive and educational dungeon crawler RPG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning to read <i>hiragana </i>is the first step in your Japanese learning journey and the first hurdle that learners struggle to overcome.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This addictive RPG dungeon crawler will have you reading Japanese in record time without all that boring study.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019360/extras/7170a5d8122c876e1d75a606879cfc4d.avif?t=1755196744\" data-has-big width=1600 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After deciding to learn Japanese, you're introduced to Keen Reflex, an online streamer who teaches viewers Japanese with his experience as a professional Japanese translator and with his JLPT N1 Japanese fluency. When you go to watch his stream, though, you are mysteriously teleported INSIDE the Japanese learning game Keen is playing. You find yourself in a magical land filled with creatures called <i>hiragana\u00a0</i>that can only be defeated by shouting their name. The only way out seems to be to make your way through puzzles and hordes of <i>hiragana</i>, leveling up your stats and your reading comprehension along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019360/extras/4a62412ab7da446c9608ac3c714a1076.avif?t=1755196744\" width=800 height=442 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Voice-Acted</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With voice actors narrating the entire story and native Japanese speakers voicing the pronunciation of hiragana and words, Hiragana Hero will keep you engaged from beginning to end and help you properly learn Japanese pronunciation as you go.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Addictive\u00a0Game Elements</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiragana Hero is a dungeon crawler RPG with roguelike elements.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more than just an educational tool, Hiragana Hero will have you solving puzzles, using strategy to defeat difficult monsters, and grinding to level up your stats and armor to prepare yourself for the next big fight!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019360/extras/b3006fa6ac79be40850bb4eaf2fd6349.avif?t=1755196744\" width=537 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to read, recognize, and use <i>hiragana\u00a0</i>as you are guided by Keen Reflex through a 35-floor ever-changing labyrinth in an addictive and educational dungeon crawler RPG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning to read <i>hiragana </i>is the first step in your Japanese learning journey and the first hurdle that learners struggle to overcome.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This addictive RPG dungeon crawler will have you reading Japanese in record time without all that boring study.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019360/extras/7170a5d8122c876e1d75a606879cfc4d.avif?t=1755196744\" data-has-big width=1600 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After deciding to learn Japanese, you're introduced to Keen Reflex, an online streamer who teaches viewers Japanese with his experience as a professional Japanese translator and with his JLPT N1 Japanese fluency. When you go to watch his stream, though, you are mysteriously teleported INSIDE the Japanese learning game Keen is playing. You find yourself in a magical land filled with creatures called <i>hiragana\u00a0</i>that can only be defeated by shouting their name. The only way out seems to be to make your way through puzzles and hordes of <i>hiragana</i>, leveling up your stats and your reading comprehension along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019360/extras/4a62412ab7da446c9608ac3c714a1076.avif?t=1755196744\" width=800 height=442 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Voice-Acted</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With voice actors narrating the entire story and native Japanese speakers voicing the pronunciation of hiragana and words, Hiragana Hero will keep you engaged from beginning to end and help you properly learn Japanese pronunciation as you go.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Addictive\u00a0Game Elements</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiragana Hero is a dungeon crawler RPG with roguelike elements.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more than just an educational tool, Hiragana Hero will have you solving puzzles, using strategy to defeat difficult monsters, and grinding to level up your stats and armor to prepare yourself for the next big fight!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Learn to read Japanese in this addictive and educational dungeon crawler RPG!",
