    "reviews": "\u201cA Must-Play for Beginners Learning Hiragana\u201d<br>Yokoso Otaku on Youtube<br><br>\u201cHonestly, I struggled so much to learn the Hiragana and I'd been doing duolingo for a long time.  Getting it gamified was life changing. Recommended it to everyone in my N5 class xD\u201d<br>NaoriMizuki on Twitch<br><br>\u201cI really enjoyed Hiragana Hero. I know I got frustrated at one point, but in the end, it was a fantastic way to learn or master hiragana.\u201d<br>Greenslade Gaming on Youtube<br>",
